# Massing run outputs. Every grid writes a folder of PNGs, JSON summaries and
# error logs under these paths - 6 MB and 169 files at the time this rule was
# written, all of it reproducible by re-running the command that made it. The
# corpus (inputs/) and the tools that read these folders stay tracked.
ARR/backend/tmp_mass_check/*/runs/
ARR/backend/tmp_mass_check/**/*.err
ARR/backend/runs/
ARR/backend/wire.txt
